Package: weathergenr
Type: Package
Title: Gridded semi-parametric weather generator
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Mehmet Umit",
    family = "Taner",
    email = "tanerumit@deltares.nl",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: A gridded, semiparametric, multivariate, multisite stochastic weather
  generator for climate risk and stress-testing applications, based on the framework
  of Steinschneider and Brown (2013) <doi:10.1002/wrcr.20528> and adapted here for
  gridded datasets and netCDF-based workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
  R (>= 4.1)
